  (text "POWER - three INDEPENDENT paths, one per module. Deliberately not commoned:\\nboard-level redundancy is meaningless if one supply can take all three down.\\nEach module still arbitrates its own inputs internally via LTC4417 (U1101).\\nBrick in -> module out; the only shared net here is GND." (at 177.8 38.1 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 4cd6f748-0209-4fd0-86cf-0bddecc6cf23)
  )
